    {
      "id": "US-ARCH-001",
      "title": "安装dependency-injector库",
      "description": "安装并配置dependency-injector库作为依赖注入容器的核心依赖",
      "acceptanceCriteria": [
        "在backend/requirements.txt中添加dependency-injector==4.41.0",
        "运行pip install更新依赖",
        "在backend/app/core/__init__.py中导入并验证安装成功",
        "运行pytest确保不影响现有测试"
